### The category tree — GET /api/v1/categories
# Every category the signed-in person has, unpaged, each naming its grouping's id and name. Needs an open
# session; no CSRF token, since it is a read.

@host = http://localhost:1000
# Set from the fb_session cookie a sign-in response sets — see session.http.
@sessionCookie = paste-the-fb_session-cookie-value-here

### Every category, unpaged.
GET {{host}}/api/v1/categories
Cookie: fb_session={{sessionCookie}}
